{"format":"list-zine","v":1,"doc":{"v":1,"title":"A zine in 10 minutes","format":"A4","fonts":{"heading":"unbounded","body":"ibm-plex-sans"},"colors":{"ink":"#0078bf","accent":"#ff6c2f","meta":"#6b6b6b"},"paper":"#dde8d6","paperPrint":true,"hf":{"header":{"on":false,"left":"{title}","center":"","right":""},"footer":{"on":true,"left":"{title}","center":"","right":"{nn}"},"skipCovers":true,"mirror":false,"rule":true},"sides":[{"type":"zine","pages":[{"blocks":[{"id":"1zppfr6","type":"heading","x":0,"y":0,"w":2,"h":2,"text":"A zine in ten minutes","size":"L","align":"left","color":"accent","knock":"","valign":"top"},{"id":"zdom8ib","type":"qr","x":2,"y":0,"w":1,"h":2,"url":"https://10minutezine.com","caption":"zines are cool","invert":0,"color":"ink","align":"force"},{"id":"5nq0fd9","type":"image","x":0,"y":2,"w":3,"h":3,"asset":"a1sq2s6gz","zoom":1.06,"px":0.5383118396313111,"py":0.4162729433444013,"filter":"dither","grain":0.6,"invert":1},{"id":"8hbrqw8","type":"text","x":0,"y":5,"w":3,"h":1,"text":"**Issue #1 autumn 2026**","text2":"","text3":"","size":"body","cols":1,"knock":"","valign":"top","color":"ink","align":"force"}],"bg":{"asset":"ayc4j9n8x","zoom":1.18,"px":0.5,"py":0.5,"filter":"gray","grain":0.4,"fade":0.9,"blur":2.1}},{"blocks":[{"id":"dmnwsgr","type":"heading","x":0,"y":0,"w":2,"h":1,"text":"What is it","size":"M","align":"left","valign":"middle"},{"id":"cryprn8","type":"image","x":2,"y":0,"w":1,"h":1,"asset":"a1sq2s6gz","zoom":1.6,"px":0.8,"py":0.5,"filter":"dither","grain":0.35},{"id":"txan0yc","type":"text","x":0,"y":1,"w":3,"h":3,"text":"A zine is a tiny self-made magazine. One sheet of paper, eight pages, no rules.\n\nHere you build it from ready-made blocks: **heading**, text, quote, image, QR code, vertical heading and text. Type sizes are already tuned for print — just fill the pages with meaning.","text2":"","text3":"","size":"body","cols":1}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"lngy39e","type":"quote","x":0,"y":0,"w":3,"h":1,"text":"Perfect is the enemy of good.","by":"the zine rule","knock":"","color":"ink","valign":"top"},{"id":"c2hoato","type":"text","x":0,"y":2,"w":2,"h":4,"text":"A page is a grid of cells. 3 × 6 by default, but each page can have its own: from 2 × 3 to 4 × 10.\n\nDrop a block on a taken spot — the neighbours move aside. Block edges snap to the next rows.\n\nThe corner of each block shows how many characters it *should* hold.","text2":"","text3":"","size":"body","cols":1,"align":"left","knock":"","valign":"top"},{"id":"vhgrid1","type":"vheading","x":2,"y":2,"w":1,"h":4,"text":"Your grid","size":"L","align":"left","color":"accent"}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"dk3exbl","type":"heading","x":0,"y":0,"w":3,"h":1,"text":"How to make it","size":"M","align":"left","color":"ink","knock":"","valign":"middle"},{"id":"2th70fk","type":"text","x":0,"y":1,"w":3,"h":4,"text":"1. Drag blocks from the left panel.\n2. Paste text — Markdown works too.\n3. Drop an image onto a page or a spread background.\n4. Out of colour ideas — “Random palette”.\n5. Check the whole sheet in the “Sheet” tab.\n6. Download the PDF and print.","text2":"","text3":"","size":"body","cols":1,"knock":"","align":"left"}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"9ca5ylr","type":"imagecap","x":0,"y":0,"w":3,"h":6,"asset":"a1sq2s6gz","zoom":1,"px":0.8955595933426309,"py":0.5,"filter":"dither","grain":0.35,"caption":"Dithering turns any photo into graphics a laser printer handles well.","color":"ink","metacolor":"auto","invert":0}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"tx6xo34","type":"heading","x":0,"y":0,"w":3,"h":1,"text":"How to fold","size":"M","align":"left","valign":"middle","knock":"fill"},{"id":"lfw9eae","type":"text","x":0,"y":1,"w":3,"h":4,"text":"- Fold the sheet in half lengthwise.\n- Unfold, fold in half widthwise, then once more.\n- Cut along the dashed line in the middle.\n- Fold lengthwise and push the ends together.\n- Flatten into a booklet.","text2":"","text3":"","size":"body","cols":1,"align":"left","color":"ink"},{"id":"aojzuia","type":"divider","x":0,"y":5,"w":3,"h":1,"style":"line"}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"7411x5q","type":"heading","x":0,"y":0,"w":3,"h":1,"text":"Printing","size":"M","align":"left","knock":"fill","valign":"middle"},{"id":"l9qr9ef","type":"text","x":0,"y":1,"w":3,"h":5,"text":"**At home:** A4 or US Letter, 100% scale, no “fit to page”. The 5 mm margins leave room for a laser printer.\n\n**At a print shop:** the “Print shop” mode adds 3 mm bleed and crop marks and turns text into outlines.\n\n**For the web:** every page as a PNG, all in one ZIP.","text2":"","text3":"","size":"body","cols":1,"knock":"fit","valign":"bottom","align":"left","color":"ink"}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"tkh48jc","type":"qr","x":0,"y":1,"w":2,"h":2,"url":"https://10minutezine.com","caption":"Anyone can start making their own zines.\n\nJust start","metacolor":"auto","qrmode":"pixel","qrimginvert":0,"invert":0,"color":"ink","qrsize":0.35,"qrzoom":3,"qrver":10,"align":"right","valign":"top"},{"id":"fk6xb6e","type":"text","x":0,"y":3,"w":2,"h":1,"text":"Application made by Daniil Vlasenko\nFonts — Google Fonts, OFL license.","text2":"","text3":"","size":"small","cols":1,"align":"force","knock":"","valign":"top"}],"grid":[2,4]}],"poster":{"orient":"portrait","blocks":[]}},{"type":"poster","pages":[{"blocks":[]},{"blocks":[]},{"blocks":[]},{"blocks":[]},{"blocks":[]},{"blocks":[]},{"blocks":[]},{"blocks":[]}],"poster":{"orient":"portrait","blocks":[{"id":"5s7wase","type":"heading","x":0,"y":0,"w":4,"h":2,"text":"POSTER ON THE BACK","size":"XL","align":"left","valign":"middle","knock":"fit"},{"id":"ucuju4m","type":"image","x":0,"y":2,"w":3,"h":7,"asset":"a1sq2s6gz","zoom":1,"px":0.8429424084901787,"py":0.5,"filter":"dither","grain":0.35},{"id":"uyimjox","type":"text","x":3,"y":2,"w":1,"h":3,"text":"Unfold the zine and there is a poster on the back.\n\nPoster blocks snap to a 4 × 10 grid the same way.","text2":"","text3":"","size":"small","cols":1},{"id":"yb6mt9l","type":"text","x":3,"y":5,"w":1,"h":2,"text":"Application made by Daniil Vlasenko","text2":"","text3":"","size":"small","cols":1,"valign":"bottom"},{"id":"7a2q8ww","type":"qr","x":3,"y":7,"w":1,"h":2,"url":"https://boosty.to/cirocular/donate","caption":"**Support the project**","valign":"top","qrpos":"end","align":"left","invert":0},{"id":"fo6ozpg","type":"divider","x":0,"y":9,"w":4,"h":1,"style":"line"}],"grid":[4,10]}}]},"assets":{"a1sq2s6gz":{"src":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","w":1200,"h":900},"ayc4j9n8x":{"src":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","w":451,"h":800}}}